test passed with `19` total tests (`PASS=1`, `SKIP=18`, `FAIL=0`).

The disposable host-network PostgreSQL 16 run used server version `160014`.
It exited `1` with `19` total tests (`PASS=7`, `FAIL=12`). The seven passing
cases were the adapter-root check, scoped idempotency, conflict preservation,
