The twelve failures were five JSONB primitive/object round trips, one
job-specific jitter dispersion case, and six replay-verifier denial cases.
JSONB values returned as JSON text. Unrelated jobs produced one delay value.
Each invalid replay receipt reached the write/audit assertion without a denial
error.

Post-run cleanup returned `CLEANUP_SCRATCH_DATABASES=0` and
`CLEANUP_TASK9_ROLES=0`. The disposable container was removed.

